{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本索女桃月梨子，有顏值又有身材，加上肯捱又肯搏的性格，近年在藝能界工作不斷。她夥拍人氣男團M!LK成員吉田仁人合演的深夜劇《溺愛～其實是最強英雄～》將於本月30日開播。近日，她便再為雜誌拍攝性感寫真，替劇集造勢。</p><p>她分別以黑白冷艷及甜美可愛的兩款造型示人，大晒火辣豐滿上圍。她又化身四眼OL，展示知性一面。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.784125+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:03:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T20:18:09.759781+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:15.489273+00:00","content_hash":"797c90d9027d3d0a9a9f6a332ecd047db9d3b2a69b75e8e3c80f0e00a2f3c3f5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.784125+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}